  "content_html": "<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"/assets/images/content/0352cbb60e412587c1.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"רישום של ילד עם כובע מצחייה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"291\" data-original-width=\"219\" src=\"/assets/images/content/0352cbb60e412587c1.png\" /></a></p><h2><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🎈&nbsp;</span><span data-end=\"108\" data-start=\"73\" style=\"font-family: arial;\">שיחה בציורים -&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כְּשֶׁהָרָצוֹן יוֹצֵא מִשְּׁלִיטָה</span></span></h2><p></p><div><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👄 <b>הַפֶּה</b> (בִּתְלוּנָה):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לָמָּה תָּמִיד אֶת אוֹתוֹ מָן?<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנִי רוֹצֶה בָּשָׂר!</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">😞 <b>הַלֵּב</b> (בְּחֶסֶר):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יֵשׁ לָנוּ הַכֹּל,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּבְכָל זֹאת אֲנִי מַרְגִּישׁ רֵיק.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🐟 </span><b style=\"font-family: arial;\">הַדָּג&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">(נִזְכַּר):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בְּמִצְרַיִם הָיָה טַעַם אַחֵר…</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🥒 <strong data-end=\"551\" data-start=\"534\">הַ</strong><b>קִּשֻּׁאִים</b>&nbsp;<em data-end=\"575\" data-start=\"552\">(</em><span data-end=\"575\" data-start=\"552\">בְּזִכָּרוֹן מָתוֹק<i>)</i></span>:<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">זָכַרְנוּ אֶת הַטַּעַם,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲבָל שָׁכַחְנוּ אֶת הָעַבְדוּת.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">😠 <b>הַתַּאֲוָה&nbsp;</b>(ברָעָב&nbsp;חָזָק):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנִי רוֹצָה עוֹד!<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לֹא מַסְפִּיק לִי מַה שֶׁיֵּשׁ.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🌬️ <b>הָרוּחַ&nbsp;</b>(בִּמְהִירוּת):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הִנֵּה אֲנִי מְבִיאָה שְׂלָו.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🐦 <b>הַשְּׂלָו&nbsp;</b>(בְּשֶׁפַע גָּדוֹל):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הִנֵּה בָּאתִי בְּכַמּוּיוֹת!<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יוֹתֵר מִמַּה שֶׁצָּרִיךְ.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👐 <b>הַיָּדַיִם&nbsp;</b>(בְּחִפָּזוֹן):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לָקַחְנוּ הַכֹּל!<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לֹא הִשְׁאַרְנוּ כְּלוּם.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">😵 <b>הַבֶּטֶן&nbsp;</b>(בִּכְאֵב):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יוֹתֵר מִדַּי…<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כָּבֵד לִי…</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">⚡ <b>הָעֹנֶשׁ&nbsp;</b>(בְּעֶצֶב):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כְּשֶׁרָצוֹן נַעֲשֶׂה תַּאֲוָה -<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הוּא פּוֹגֵעַ בָּאָדָם.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">⚰️&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>קִבְרוֹת הַתַּאֲוָה&nbsp;</b>(בְּשֶׁקֶט כָּבֵד):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כָּאן נִלְמַד שֶׁלֹּא כָּל מַה שֶׁרוֹצִים - טוֹב לָנוּ.</span></span></p><h2 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">תפזורת שמות</span></h2></div><div><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span><span>מצאו את&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">🔍</strong><span>&nbsp;השמות בפרשה: אַהֲרֹן, מֹשֶׁה, חֹבָב, רְעוּאֵל, אֶלְדָּד, מֵידָד, מִרְיָם, יְהוֹשֻׁעַ.</span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בכיוונים&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">⬅️ ➡️ ⬇️ ⬆️</span></span><br /><a href=\"/assets/images/content/60d2c016083e75e2b3.png\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"/assets/images/content/60d2c016083e75e2b3.png\" /></a><br /><h2 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">נכון או לא בפרשה?</span></h2></div><div><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּפָרָשַׁת בְּהַעֲלֹתְךָ מְצֻוִּים לְהַדְלִיק אֶת הַמְּנוֹרָה?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַלְּוִיִּים הֵם שֶׁמַּדְלִיקִים אֶת הַמְּנוֹרָה?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַמְּנוֹרָה עָמְדָה בְּתוֹךְ הַמִּשְׁכָּן?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲנָשִׁים שֶׁהָיוּ טְמֵאִים - יְכוֹלִים לַעֲשׂוֹת פֶּסַח שֵׁנִי?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הֶעָנָן הֶרְאָה מָתַי לַחֲנוֹת וּמָתַי לִנְסֹעַ?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל בִּקְּשׁוּ יַיִן?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַתַּאֲוָה לְבָשָׂר הֵבִיאָה לְעֹנֶשׁ?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מֹשֶׁה הִצְטַוָּה לְהָכִין 3 חֲצוֹצְרוֹת?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַשְּׂלָו הוּא דָּג טָעִים?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ה' נָתַן לְמֹשֶׁה עוֹזְרִים לְהַנְהִיג אֶת הָעָם?</span></li></ol></div>"
}
